Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.32,Main,,0,0,0,,The little woman outside Zhengyangmen also got five nominations, competition was fierce
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.32,0:00:08.20,Main,,0,0,0,,That night, the awards for performance and likeness swept the board
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:13.56,Main,,0,0,0,,The Ni Dahong and Guo Jinfei handled by the Su family won Best Actor and Best Supporting Actor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.56,0:00:15.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Ni Dahong said in an interview
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.84,0:00:19.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Su Daqiang as a father figure is different from the ones before
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:21.00,Main,,0,0,0,,This father is too real
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:25.72,Main,,0,0,0,,He's real, too real
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.72,0:00:28.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Most people, over ninety percent, say
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.12,0:00:30.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Our family has this situation too
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.56,0:00:31.04,Main,,0,0,0,,That is to say
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:32.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I start from this kind of probability
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:35.36,Main,,0,0,0,,When I'm performing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.36,0:00:37.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't think about deliberately acting anything
